<img decoding="async" width="225" height="300" title="Gayatri 1-compressed" src="https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Gayatri-1-compressed.jpg" data-orig-src="https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Gayatri-1-compressed-225x300.jpg" class="lazyload img-responsive wp-image-1004 img-with-aspect-ratio" data-parent-fit="cover" data-parent-container=".fusion-image-element" alt srcset="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%271440%27%20height%3D%271920%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%201440%201920%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%271440%27%20height%3D%271920%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" data-srcset="https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Gayatri-1-compressed-200x267.jpg 200w, https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Gayatri-1-compressed-400x533.jpg 400w, https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Gayatri-1-compressed-600x800.jpg 600w, https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Gayatri-1-compressed-800x1067.jpg 800w, https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Gayatri-1-compressed-1200x1600.jpg 1200w, https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Gayatri-1-compressed.jpg 1440w" data-sizes="auto" data-orig-sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1919px) 400px,(min-width: 1920px) 25vw" /></span></div></div><div class="fusion-text fusion-text-4" style="--awb-text-color:#000000;"><p>&#8220;All Purpose Yoga Studio in Boulder is a gem. Greatly enjoyed a class with Gayatri. She is a gifted teacher with much knowledge and expertise of both the postures and the healing energy of yoga! Thank you!&#8221;</p><p style="padding-left: 40px;">— Daria R.</p></div></div></div><div class="fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-15 fusion_builder_column_1_4 1_4 fusion-flex-column" style="--awb-padding-top:30px;--awb-padding-right:30px;--awb-padding-left:30px;--awb-overflow:hidden;--awb-bg-color:var(--awb-color4);--awb-bg-color-hover:var(--awb-color4);--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-box-shadow:0px 0px 32px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.37);;--awb-border-radius:24px 24px 24px 24px;--awb-width-large:25%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:7.68%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:30px;--awb-spacing-left-large:7.68%;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-order-medium:0;--awb-spacing-right-medium:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:1.92%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-order-small:5;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;"><div class="fusion-column-wrapper fusion-column-has-shadow fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column"><div class="fusion-image-element" style="text-align:center;--awb-aspect-ratio:1 / 1;--awb-object-position:37% 11%;--awb-mask-url: url(https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/plugins/fusion-builder//assets/images/masks/mask-10.svg);--awb-margin-bottom:20px;--awb-max-width:150px;--awb-caption-title-font-family:var(--h2_typography-font-family);--awb-caption-title-font-weight:var(--h2_typography-font-weight);--awb-caption-title-font-style:var(--h2_typography-font-style);--awb-caption-title-size:var(--h2_typography-font-size);--awb-caption-title-transform:var(--h2_typography-text-transform);--awb-caption-title-line-height:var(--h2_typography-line-height);--awb-caption-title-letter-spacing:var(--h2_typography-letter-spacing);"><div style="display:inline-block;width:150px;"><span class=" fusion-imageframe imageframe-none imageframe-5 hover-type-none has-mask has-aspect-ratio"><img decoding="async" width="259" height="300" title="IMG_4477-compressed" src="https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IMG_4477-compressed.jpg" data-orig-src="https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IMG_4477-compressed-259x300.jpg" class="lazyload img-responsive wp-image-1474 img-with-aspect-ratio" data-parent-fit="cover" data-parent-container=".fusion-image-element" alt srcset="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%271179%27%20height%3D%271366%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%201179%201366%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%271179%27%20height%3D%271366%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" data-srcset="https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IMG_4477-compressed-200x232.jpg 200w, https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IMG_4477-compressed-400x463.jpg 400w, https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IMG_4477-compressed-600x695.jpg 600w, https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IMG_4477-compressed-800x927.jpg 800w, https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IMG_4477-compressed.jpg 1179w" data-sizes="auto" data-orig-sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1919px) 400px,(min-width: 1920px) 25vw" /></span></div></div><div class="fusion-text fusion-text-5"><p>&#8220;So grateful that All Purpose exists! Such a special studio that is heart-led and so inviting. The space is full of beautiful light, and adorned with plants and alter items. I felt right at home when I arrived and loved my vinyasa class with Jade. Highly recommend checking out Boulder&#8217;s newest yoga studio!&#8221;</p><p style="padding-left: 40px;">— Brooke A.</p></div></div></div><div class="fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-16 fusion_builder_column_1_4 1_4 fusion-flex-column" style="--awb-padding-top:30px;--awb-padding-right:30px;--awb-padding-left:30px;--awb-overflow:hidden;--awb-bg-color:var(--awb-color4);--awb-bg-color-hover:var(--awb-color4);--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-box-shadow:0px 0px 32px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.37);;--awb-border-radius:24px 24px 24px 24px;--awb-width-large:25%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:7.68%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:30px;--awb-spacing-left-large:7.68%;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-order-medium:0;--awb-spacing-right-medium:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:1.92%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-order-small:6;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;"><div class="fusion-column-wrapper fusion-column-has-shadow fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column"><div class="fusion-image-element" style="text-align:center;--awb-aspect-ratio:1 / 1;--awb-object-position:18% 54%;--awb-mask-url: url(https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/plugins/fusion-builder//assets/images/masks/mask-10.svg);--awb-margin-bottom:20px;--awb-max-width:150px;--awb-caption-title-font-family:var(--h2_typography-font-family);--awb-caption-title-font-weight:var(--h2_typography-font-weight);--awb-caption-title-font-style:var(--h2_typography-font-style);--awb-caption-title-size:var(--h2_typography-font-size);--awb-caption-title-transform:var(--h2_typography-text-transform);--awb-caption-title-line-height:var(--h2_typography-line-height);--awb-caption-title-letter-spacing:var(--h2_typography-letter-spacing);"><div style="display:inline-block;width:150px;"><span class=" fusion-imageframe imageframe-none imageframe-6 hover-type-none has-mask has-aspect-ratio"><img decoding="async" width="300" height="259" title="Image 5-28-26 at 10.17 PM" src="https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Image-5-28-26-at-10.17-PM.jpeg" data-orig-src="https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Image-5-28-26-at-10.17-PM-300x259.jpeg" class="lazyload img-responsive wp-image-1663 img-with-aspect-ratio" data-parent-fit="cover" data-parent-container=".fusion-image-element" alt srcset="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27530%27%20height%3D%27458%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20530%20458%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27530%27%20height%3D%27458%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" data-srcset="https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Image-5-28-26-at-10.17-PM-200x173.jpeg 200w, https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Image-5-28-26-at-10.17-PM-400x346.jpeg 400w, https://allpurposeyoga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Image-5-28-26-at-10.17-PM.jpeg 530w" data-sizes="auto" data-orig-sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1919px) 400px,(min-width: 1920px) 25vw" /></span></div></div><div class="fusion-text fusion-text-6"><p>&#8220;Carlie invited me in to FINALLY have my first flow with you. I&#8217;m so happy to see what&#8217;s been created here and the sweet and deeply nurturing ambiance of the space and community. I can&#8217;t wait to be back again!&#8221;</p><p style="padding-left: 40px;">— Kaitlyn R.</p></div></div></div><div class="fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-17 fusion_builder_column_1_1 1_1 fusion-flex-column" style="--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:100%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:1.92%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:0px;--awb-spacing-left-large:1.92%;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-order-medium:0;--awb-spacing-right-medium:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:1.92%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-order-small:0;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;"><div class="fusion-column-wrapper fusion-column-has-shadow fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column"><div class="fusion-separator fusion-full-width-sep" style="align-self: center;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto;margin-top:80px;width:100%;"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-6 fusion-flex-container nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling" style="--link_color: rgba(234,225,214,0.48);--awb-background-position:center bottom;--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;--awb-padding-top:0px;--awb-padding-bottom:0%;--awb-background-color:var(--awb-color4);--awb-flex-wrap:wrap;" ><div class="fusion-builder-row fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start fusion-flex-content-wrap" style="max-width:1185.6px;margin-